behavior.text:
for each entry: `rec[1] = slot`, `rec[0x1B5] = 1`, `UnitWork_BuildFromSaveIndex(rec, entry[0], 0)`,
  `Unit_ResolvePreviewShape(rec, &pal, rec[3])` -> `rec[0x18F]/0x190`, `rec[0x191] = sprite number`.
  The sprite number counts down from -2 for `a2 != 0` and up from 120 for `a2 == 0`.

picks the formula by action type `byte_14067E010[type]`:
  - 0/3/6: weapon formula from the weapon record (`WeaponRecord[2]`, `0x140309B7C`);
  - 1: item/chemist record (`Item_GetChemistRecord`, `0x140309E63`);
  - 2: formula 99; 4: terrain formula (`byte_14067F750[...]`); 7/8/9/10: ability table / specials.

for each of the 40 bits in the pending clears `rec+0x1E0..0x1E4`: clear the bit in `rec+0x1EF..0x1F3`,
  call `Unit_SetStatusCountdown(rec, status, 1)`, and (unless previewing) update the status icon with
  `BattleUnit_SetStatusVisual(status+1, 0, slot)`.

